      "writtenOn": "2025-01-10T02:05:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While this patch is for SCO data, some thoughts for setting USB interface with device_gruop:\n\nCertain btusb devices have an extra USB interface (e.g. iso_alt for LE audio ISO data). If we\u0027d like to manage the extra USB interface configuration in the same way (in user space), we\u0027d better make new attribute (e.g. iso_alt) only available for these devices.",
      "parentUuid": "c7c7fe58_ea5dd21a",
      "revId": "07d79680193f0e9b12738684c79f57afcbbe3e2b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
